    "questionText": "<div class=\"original-stem\">Eight girls A–H need to go for dance sessions in two batches of four girls each.<br>(1) B and H must go together.<br>(2) D and F do not go together.<br>(3) A and C never go together.<br>If B and C go in the first batch, who can be in the second batch?</div>",
