    "questionText": "<div class=\"original-stem\">Suraj borrowed a sum from Ajay at a certain rate of simple interest for 2 years and lent it to Vinay at same compound interest rate for 2 years. At end he received CI Rs.1230 and paid SI Rs.1200. Find principal and rate.</div>",
