    "subjectCode": "quant",
    "topicCode": "ratio_and_algebra",
    "questionText": "<div class=\"original-stem\">Two numbers are in the ratio 6 : 7 and if 16 is added to the first number and 16 is subtracted from the second number then, the ratio becomes 2 : 1. What is the difference between these two numbers?</div>",
