    "questionText": "<div class=\"original-stem\">An amount of money is to be divided between Praveen, Pankaj and Rohan in the ratio of 4 : 5 : 9. If the difference between the shares of Pankaj and Rohan is Rs. 6720. What is the total amount of money?</div>",
