    "questionText": "<div class=\"original-stem\">Four friends P, Q, R and S have some money among them. First P gives Q what Q had initially, then Q gives R what R had initially, then R gives S what S had initially, and finally S gives P what P had then. Each ends with Rs.124. What amount did S have initially?</div>",
