    "questionText": "An amount of Rs. 500000 is split into 2 parts and each part is invested in two types of bonds. The first yields an interest of 8 percent p.a. and\nsecond, 12 percent p.a. If the total interest on both the parts at the end of 1 year is 10.5 percent p.a., then what was the amount invested in each\ntype of bond?",
